  "note": "Strict222 TDRP-R9-MICROTEX-RES-CYRILLIC-MAP-XML-PROVENANCE-001: res/cyrillic/cyrillic.map.xml@5431dc86108e722f7899fbf3db4db7af67badcc4 is 5,472 bytes/101 line slots with 93 unique SymbolMapping entries, 93 unique codepoints, all fontId=wnr10. Exact history is one root init commit 17f3fc7816e4de1f5764036f34d759d50098ae58; page2 empty; the root commit has no parent and its recursive tree f8a661f00ff420f91227f4e2bb1a3c39405a7bdd is truncated=false/171 with the target. language_cyrillic.xml includes cyrillic.map.xml and wnr10 metrics; historical XML parsing mapped name/ch/fontId into CharFont while mappings_cyrillic.xml maps Unicode characters to those symbol names. Accepted MicroTeX 61aaa7cc strips the tinyxml loader: addTeXFontDescription throws ex_alphabet_registration, the Cyrillic block is marked loaded, and missing symbol/formula mappings fall through to the external-font handler, so this XML is dormant in accepted tdesktop runtime. RES_README lists it and Meson installs the whole res/cyrillic subtree. bundled.qrc has 30 entries and zero Cyrillic/Greek entries; accepted tdesktop links external_microtex, registers bundled qrc/.rcc, calls initBundled, and macOS ships external_microtex_bundled.rcc. README excludes res/cyrillic from the project MIT blanket and res/cyrillic/LICENSE is GPLv3. Existing-owner-first selects TDRP recursive resource/font/parser/license/install/packaging provenance; no MicroTeX/Cyrillic runtime or parallel owner is added. Counters unknown=16154 unread=16129 omitted=0 responsibilities=240. Parent f8b6d255 exact-head TDRP 61/61, Rust 6/6, Official MCP 1/1. Receipt-head Actions required. Next res/cyrillic/language_cyrillic.xml@b638f957889b97b24d1f6d98c615e4290acab1a8.",
